{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Aztecs</strong> \u2014 a mighty Mesoamerican civilization that thrived for over three centuries, ruling vast territories and forging one of the most awe-inspiring societies in human history. A people of vision and strength, steeped in rich traditions, powerful deities, and sacred rituals. You are <strong>Tlatoani</strong>, a divine Aztec leader, born to shape the destiny of your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/433c42613d1ba1b801208b3743e37868.poster.avif?t=1758651358\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/433c42613d1ba1b801208b3743e37868.webm?t=1758651358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct </strong>and <strong>develop </strong>the majestic city-state of <strong>Tenochtitlan </strong>- built amidst the waters of <strong>Lake Texcoco</strong>. <strong>Reclaim valuable land</strong>, <strong>feed your people</strong>, <strong>raise monumental structures</strong>, and maintain vital <strong>trade routes</strong> that connect your floating empire to the outside world in the <strong>Valley of Mexico</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/65e7c54515fad0f7ed8509c124f859e5.poster.avif?t=1758651358\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/65e7c54515fad0f7ed8509c124f859e5.webm?t=1758651358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet beyond these petty struggles looms a far <strong>greater threat</strong>: the <strong>Moon Goddess</strong> has declared war upon the Sun, casting a <strong>dreadful curse</strong> upon your followers. Only blood, spilled through <strong>human sacrifice</strong>, can summon a <strong>shield of protection</strong> - but its power is fleeting. How many nights will your people survive before the darkness consumes them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/1239f4edd3431c2a74d244a1f987ba86.avif?t=1758651358\" width=250 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and expand</strong> the legendary city-state of <strong>Tenochtitlan </strong>on an island in Lake Texcoco using over <strong>25 different types of buildings</strong> with individual upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong> while you lead your people through an epic <strong>story-driven campaign</strong> spanning several acts and face mighty <strong>supernatural antagonists</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>canals </strong>and <strong>water reservoirs</strong> to <strong>reclaim precious land</strong> from the lake using advanced <strong>terraforming </strong>systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appease the gods through <strong>rituals and human sacrifice</strong> to <strong>gather blood</strong> for divine protection and face a dark menace that threatens your city\u2019s survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance <strong>economic</strong>, <strong>religious </strong>and <strong>survival </strong>systems, convert refugees into valuable members of your society, put them to hard labor - or <strong>sacrifice them!</strong> Assign roles to <strong>captives</strong>, <strong>commoners</strong>, <strong>nobles </strong>and <strong>priests</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dispatch expeditions</strong> from the strategic map all across the <strong>Valley of Mexico</strong> to ensure your city thrives through <strong>resource gathering</strong> and <strong>trade</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct <strong>monumental buildings</strong> like huge <strong>temples</strong>, <strong>academies </strong>and <strong>gardens </strong>that showcase your civilization's glory and spiritual devotion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/7e3f4989af2cc41f998f10aa18f36ed8.poster.avif?t=1758651358\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/7e3f4989af2cc41f998f10aa18f36ed8.webm?t=1758651358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You know nothing, Tlatoani","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/a5c545d5fa5afb604f2d7fd7e866369f78b917de.jpg"},{"name":"That\u2019s no moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/e7ae2012bc255d42533be0418353bbb85f4f6716.jpg"},{"name":"There will be blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/fe8811a25218709d0d20a587ffdb5b75cfefe8f4.jpg"},{"name":"We built this city","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/3afa3e593bad273633acb806782ea24366ca5ef8.jpg"},{"name":"Second breakfast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/74387ed5dd55f1d1337185d89a7d08080937a51a.jpg"},{"name":"Big brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/575491236c2e479ab67d24ebebc1e254d8857247.jpg"},{"name":"Better, faster, stronger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/2982627500b06b8645fcb85b8f666e8329d90d6f.jpg"},{"name":"This is fine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/ab0f08aee7e267ff8680643edcc1050cfbd454cb.jpg"},{"name":"Temple run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/f9b4fce053022856a9cb8b0f4b7c8e9f22fd97b8.jpg"},{"name":"Eat the rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1409840/ee697f749ebb261e6268b933472e7c3d3edc72b1.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1409840?t=1758651358","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/1437c8331cd2e3930257a677164eb301988fbdb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758651358","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/8c5b5191e95d58a4e8026e2c42a9227afa607781/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758651358","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/8c5b5191e95d58a4e8026e2c42a9227afa607781/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758651358","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game is based on historically accurate data and takes place in the early days of the Aztecs, focusing on the founding and expansion of the city-state of Tenochtitl\u00e1n. Human sacrifice, which was a part of this culture, has been integrated into gameplay. Players will be confronted with this on an abstracted level."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/954d35410f589d0d7f07f6e555f899ee.avif?t=1758651358\" width=616 height=1094 /></span></p></p><br><h1>GAME EDITIONS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/81b3a2170f03db2e495edee074eab2c3.avif?t=1758651358\" width=616 height=738 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Aztecs</strong> \u2014 a mighty Mesoamerican civilization that thrived for over three centuries, ruling vast territories and forging one of the most awe-inspiring societies in human history. A people of vision and strength, steeped in rich traditions, powerful deities, and sacred rituals. You are <strong>Tlatoani</strong>, a divine Aztec leader, born to shape the destiny of your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/433c42613d1ba1b801208b3743e37868.poster.avif?t=1758651358\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/433c42613d1ba1b801208b3743e37868.webm?t=1758651358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct </strong>and <strong>develop </strong>the majestic city-state of <strong>Tenochtitlan </strong>- built amidst the waters of <strong>Lake Texcoco</strong>. <strong>Reclaim valuable land</strong>, <strong>feed your people</strong>, <strong>raise monumental structures</strong>, and maintain vital <strong>trade routes</strong> that connect your floating empire to the outside world in the <strong>Valley of Mexico</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/65e7c54515fad0f7ed8509c124f859e5.poster.avif?t=1758651358\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/65e7c54515fad0f7ed8509c124f859e5.webm?t=1758651358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet beyond these petty struggles looms a far <strong>greater threat</strong>: the <strong>Moon Goddess</strong> has declared war upon the Sun, casting a <strong>dreadful curse</strong> upon your followers. Only blood, spilled through <strong>human sacrifice</strong>, can summon a <strong>shield of protection</strong> - but its power is fleeting. How many nights will your people survive before the darkness consumes them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/1239f4edd3431c2a74d244a1f987ba86.avif?t=1758651358\" width=250 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and expand</strong> the legendary city-state of <strong>Tenochtitlan </strong>on an island in Lake Texcoco using over <strong>25 different types of buildings</strong> with individual upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong> while you lead your people through an epic <strong>story-driven campaign</strong> spanning several acts and face mighty <strong>supernatural antagonists</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>canals </strong>and <strong>water reservoirs</strong> to <strong>reclaim precious land</strong> from the lake using advanced <strong>terraforming </strong>systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appease the gods through <strong>rituals and human sacrifice</strong> to <strong>gather blood</strong> for divine protection and face a dark menace that threatens your city\u2019s survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance <strong>economic</strong>, <strong>religious </strong>and <strong>survival </strong>systems, convert refugees into valuable members of your society, put them to hard labor - or <strong>sacrifice them!</strong> Assign roles to <strong>captives</strong>, <strong>commoners</strong>, <strong>nobles </strong>and <strong>priests</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dispatch expeditions</strong> from the strategic map all across the <strong>Valley of Mexico</strong> to ensure your city thrives through <strong>resource gathering</strong> and <strong>trade</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct <strong>monumental buildings</strong> like huge <strong>temples</strong>, <strong>academies </strong>and <strong>gardens </strong>that showcase your civilization's glory and spiritual devotion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409840/extras/7e3f4989af2cc41f998f10aa18f36ed8.poster.avif?t=1758651358\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati